ons, covers loop-exit branch\n    assert minPath(grid, 0) == []\n    # k=1: only i%2==0 True-branch\n    assert minPath(grid, 1) == [1]\n    # k=2: covers both i%2==0 True and False branches\n    assert minPath(grid, 2) == [1, 2]\n```\n",
